{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12904","headline":"鲁中送从事归荥阳 · 韩翃","name":"鲁中送从事归荥阳","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"故园衰草带荥波，岁晚知如君思何。\n轻橐归时鲁缟薄，寒衣缝处郑绵多。\n万人都督鸣骝送，百里邦君枉骑过。\n累路尽逢知己在，曾无对酒不高歌。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩翃","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12904.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12904","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}